      "report_md": "# Incident Report \u2014 case_blackcat\n\n> Generated by CONTRA (Anti-Forensic Contradiction Engine). Autonomous triage; every finding is traced to the tool execution that produced it.\n\n## Executive summary\n\n- **Verdict:** MALICIOUS ACTIVITY CONFIRMED\n- **Findings:** 3 (1\u00d7 CRITICAL, 2\u00d7 HIGH)\n- **Artifacts examined:** 8\n- **Autonomous iterations:** 9\n- **Self-corrections (contradictions caught):** 3\n\n## Findings\n\n### 1. [R1 \u00b7 HIGH] T1070.006 Indicator Removal: Timestomp\n\n$SI created 2019-03-12T08:14:02 predates $FN created 2026-06-01T22:41:09 by 2638d \u2014 $SI timestamp was forged.\n\n- **Why believed:** trusted `MFTECmd:$FILE_NAME` over `MFTECmd:$STANDARD_INFORMATION` \u2014 the distrusted source is the cheaper to forge.\n- **Confidence (trust delta):** 0.60\n- **Analyst pivot taken:** confirm real execution time via get_prefetch / get_amcache\n- **Provenance:** `MFTECmd -f $MFT --json -`\n\n### 2. [R2 \u00b7 CRITICAL] T1055 Process Injection / fileless execution\n\nprocess evil.exe resident in memory but no backing file on disk.\n\n- **Why believed:** trusted `volatility3.pslist` over `filesystem` \u2014 the distrusted source is the cheaper to forge.\n- **Confidence (trust delta):** 0.45\n- **Analyst pivot taken:** dump process with memory tools; check netscan for C2 socket\n- **Provenance:** `vol -f memory.raw -r json windows.pslist`\n\n### 3. [R3 \u00b7 HIGH] T1070.001 Indicator Removal: Clear Windows Event Logs\n\nSRUM shows network/app activity but event log is empty \u2014 logs cleared.\n\n- **Why believed:** trusted `SrumECmd` over `eventlog` \u2014 the distrusted source is the cheaper to forge.\n- **Confidence (trust delta):** 0.38\n- **Analyst pivot taken:** check $UsnJrnl for evtx deletion; correlate SRUM timeframe\n- **Provenance:** `SrumECmd -f SRUDB.dat --json -`\n\n## Self-correction trace\n\nThe agent did not trust tool output at face value. Each entry below is a point where evidence contradicted itself and the agent re-weighted:\n\n- iter 1: **R1** T1070.006 Indicator Removal: Timestomp -- believed `MFTECmd:$FILE_NAME`, flagged `MFTECmd:$STANDARD_INFORMATION` as tampered -> pivoted: confirm real execution time via get_prefetch / get_amcache\n- iter 2: **R2** T1055 Process Injection / fileless execution -- believed `volatility3.pslist`, flagged `filesystem` as tampered -> pivoted: dump process with memory tools; check netscan for C2 socket\n- iter 7: **R3** T1070.001 Indicator Removal: Clear Windows Event Logs -- believed `SrumECmd`, flagged `eventlog` as tampered -> pivoted: check $UsnJrnl for evtx deletion; correlate SRUM timeframe\n\n## Evidence provenance\n\n| Artifact | Source tool | Trust | Command | Evidence SHA-256 |\n|----------|-------------|-------|---------|------------------|\n| mft_fn_timestamp | MFTECmd | 0.9 | `MFTECmd -f $MFT --json -` | `a55cc9c216436dc0\u2026` |\n| memory_proc | volatility3.pslist | 0.95 | `vol -f memory.raw -r json windows.pslist` | `1a5b051ea6a7ab30\u2026` |\n| amcache | AmcacheParser | 0.8 | `AmcacheParser -f Amcache.hve --json -` | `e9fd4d95f019ce72\u2026` |\n| prefetch | PECmd | 0.8 | `PECmd -d Windows/Prefetch --json -` | `b8a6c0e8d792ee4b\u2026` |\n| usnjrnl | MFTECmd.usn | 0.85 | `MFTECmd -f $J --json -` | `9c0b724fb9229b89\u2026` |\n| srum | SrumECmd | 0.78 | `SrumECmd -f SRUDB.dat --json -` | `a285e5cebc8bb76c\u2026` |\n| eventlog | evtx | 0.4 | `vol -f memory.raw -r json windows.evtxlog` | `37517e5f3dc66819\u2026` |\n| memory_netconn | volatility3.netscan | 0.95 | `vol -f memory.raw -r json windows.netscan` | `1a6fc18db350735c\u2026` |\n"
